WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.389
Today we will communicate ideas through body movement. Our work connects with our own

00:00:05.389 --> 00:00:06.131
local community.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.193
Choose a character and identify one important action.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:14.383
Try three gestures that communicate the action without words.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.635
Show your gesture sequence while a friend identifies the story.
